time: 3/4
about: A slow, bittersweet orchestral waltz in A-flat major: a Viennese lilt on the harp, a singing string theme answered by the horns, a lighter flute second theme, a dark middle in F minor, a slow climb back, and a coda that slows onto a soft final chord.

